  "worked_solution": "We have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\overset{\\to }{OA}=a=i+j, \\\\  & \\overset{\\to }{OB}=b=3i+2j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, from $△OAB$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\\overset{\\to }{AO}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =b-a \\\\  & =(3i+2j)-(i+j) \\\\  & =2i+j.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
